  • Sponsors: Columbia Lions Club and the Sunsnappers • Start: Columbia
  Borough Fire Department (10th and Manor Streets / 726 Manor St.) • Rout
 e: • Manor Street to 4th Street • 4th Street to Union Street • Union
  Street to Second Street • Second Street to Locust Street • Locust Str
 eet to Sixth 
