SUMMARY:Southern End Poll Greeting Interest Form for 11/3
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T040000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T170000
UID:dc4308db47ebad3aaf8fb54c93a20fb8@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Untitled%20%2820%29_20260406201551781393.png
DESCRIPTION:We need YOU as a poll greeter for the Southern End! Poll Greet
 ers are needed at all of the Southern End's polling places throughout the 
 day on Election Day! Poll Greeters hand out sample ballots and candidate l
 iterature\, answer voter questions\, and are a friendly Democratic Party f
 ace for local voters. This year more than ever\, we also need your eyes an
